# Trivy ignore policy (same spirit as deny.toml advisories.ignore):
#
# - Prefer fixing or upgrading over ignoring.
# - Every ignored finding needs: why it is accepted, what clears it, and an expiry.
# - Use Trivy's expiry syntax so ignores cannot live forever:
#     CVE-YYYY-NNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
# - Revisit on or before the expiry date; remove the line when fixed or no longer needed.
# - Prefer ignoring only fixable noise that does not affect this image's runtime.
#
# No ignores are active yet. Add entries below this line when needed.
